  "description": "Lightweight, pure-managed IPosTagger for Philter.NET — a faithful C# port of\n      nltk's averaged-perceptron POS tagger (the tagger philter-lite itself uses).\n      Embeds the ~5.5 MB JSON model; no native dependencies, no network, emits Penn\n      Treebank tags directly. A small-footprint alternative to Philter.NET.Catalyst\n      for consumers who only need POS (not NER).",
